# LANDFALL: creatures, and what was taken from a room, come back once Wick
# is three rooms away (counting steps across the grid), or when she goes
# down into the dungeon or up out of it. Walking in on top of a creature's
# spot means it isn't there. What she opens stays open.
game landfall
wait 5
cheat planet 2
cheat god
cheat room 11 140 70
expect mobs == 2
cheat hold 4 1
cheat res 2 5
press A
expect mobs == 0
expect spawns_taken == 2
expect room_dirty11 == 1
# two rooms away and back: still gone
cheat room 13 140 70
expect room_dirty11 == 1
cheat room 11 140 70
expect mobs == 0
# three rooms away: back again
cheat room 14 140 70
expect room_dirty11 == 0
cheat room 11 140 70
expect mobs == 2
# in on top of one's spot: it isn't there
wait 40
press A
cheat room 14 140 70
cheat room 11 146 34
expect mobs == 1
# down into the dungeon: everything comes back
wait 40
press A
expect room_dirty11 == 1
cheat room 92 140 70
expect area == 1
expect room_dirty11 == 0
# a crystal gate broken stays broken
cheat room 5 130 114
expect gate1_kind == 3
expect gate1_open == 0
cheat face 0
press B 3
expect active == 1
press A
wait 20
cheat pos 146 114
press A
wait 20
expect gate1_open == 1
cheat room 92 140 70
cheat room 14 140 70
cheat room 5 130 114
expect gate1_open == 1
